OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAlfred Brendel plays Beethoven's
OL,6,     GPiano Concerto No.3 in an archive
OL,7,     Grecording with the Bavarian Radio
OL,8,     GSymphony Orchestra, plus pianist
OL,9,     GJaedan Isik-Dzurko with a
OL,10,     Gmasterpiece by Bach.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GAn Epiphany Carol Service from St
OL,13,     GLuke's, Chelsea, London, with
OL,14,     Gmusic by Sheppard, Clemens,
OL,15,     GCrotch, Morten Lauridsen, Philip
OL,16,     GStopford, John Rutter and
OL,17,     GBruckner.
OL,18,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,19,     GDonald Macleod follows Copland's
OL,20,     Gquest for a music that speaks of
OL,21,     GAmerica.
